<title>FRANCE: Havas H1 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Havas H1 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable after goodwill	  413  vs	     406</p>
<p>    Net attributable before goodwill	 517  vs	     512</p>
<p>    Operating					443  vs	     504</p>
<p>    Non-operating income			 192  vs	     115</p>
<p>    Pre-tax					  828  vs	     878</p>
<p>    Consolidated net income		    599  vs	     611</p>
<p>    Revenues				    23,781  vs	  21,897</p>
<p>    Investments				  1.240  vs	     849</p>
<p>Nte cash</p>
<p>NOTE -</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452  </p>
<p>NOTE - Havas gave the figures in a statement. It said the 1995 figures were pro forma to reflect the acquisition of Generale Occidentale.</p>
</text>
